# Description
This disables the `MPICH_COLL_OPT_OFF` switch previously set in `WCOSS.env`.  In doing so, collective MPI calls like Alltoall and Allgather are now optimized and this removes the occurrence of warnings stating they are not optimized in the logs.  This change also seems to slightly improve runtime.

Resolves #1052 

